","phrase":"No, they aren't"},"id":"b1-u08-q03"},{"type":"cloze","kind":"text","prompt":"补全句子：Are your friends _____ too?","hint":"你们的朋友也是游客吗？","answer":"tourists","placeholder":"输入缺失的单词","explain":"Are your friends tourists too? — 你们的朋友也是游客吗？","source":{"kind":"sentence","en":"Are your friends tourists too?"},"id":"b1-u08-q04"},{"type":"grammar-choice","kind":"choice","prompt":"“表示否定、拒绝或相反的情况。口语中常用缩略形式isn't, aren't, aren't” 描述的是哪个语法点？","hint":"主语 + be动词 + not + ...","options":["一般现在时描述四季气候","简略否定句 (Short Negative Responses)","How are you? 询问身体状况句型","否定句（be动词的否定形式）"],"answer":3,"explain":"否定句（be动词的否定形式）：主语 + be动词 + not + ...：表示否定、拒绝或相反的情况。口语中常用缩略形式isn't, aren't, aren't","source":{"kind":"grammar","title":"否定句（be动词的否定形式）"},"id":"b1-u08-q05"},{"type":"translation-choice","kind":"choice","prompt":"选出下面句子的正确中文意思：\nYes we are.","hint":"","options":["他们中的一些人正走进公园。","他说他住在青年旅社。","是的，我们是。","我数出了七辆旧汽车和三台旧冰箱。"],"answer":2,"explain":"Yes we are. — 是的，我们是。","source":{"kind":"sentence","en":"Yes we are."},"id":"b1-u08-q06"}],"grammar":[{"title":"含有be动词的一般疑问句","definition":"用Yes或No回答的疑问句，询问某人的身份、国籍或物品归属","structure":"Be动词(Am/Is/Are) + 主语 + ...?","usage":"用于询问国籍、职业、身份或物品归属。肯定回答用Yes+主语+be动词；否定回答用No+主语+be动词+not","examples":[{"en":"Are you Swedish?","zh":"你是瑞典人吗？"},{"en":"Is this your passport?","zh":"这是你的护照吗？"},{"en":"Are they Danish too?","zh":"他们也是丹麦人吗？"}]},{"title":"否定句（be动词的否定形式）","definition":"在be动词后加not构成否定句","structure":"主语 + be动词 + not + ...","usage":"表示否定、拒绝或相反的情况。口语中常用缩略形式isn't, aren't, aren't","examples":[{"en":"We are not Swedish. We are Danish.","zh":"我们不是瑞典人，我们是丹麦人。"},{"en":"No, they aren't. They are Norwegian.","zh":"不，他们不是。他们是挪威人。"},{"en":"These aren't our cases. Our cases are brown.","zh":"这些不是我们的箱子。我们的箱子是棕色的。"}]},{"title":"名词所有格（our）","definition":"our是we的所有格形式，表示'我们的'","structure":"our + 名词","usage":"表示某物属于'我们'，后面接名词","examples":[{"en":"Our cases are brown.","zh":"我们的箱子是棕色的。"},{"en":"Are these our passports?","zh":"这些是我们的护照吗？"}]}],"patterns":[{"pattern":"Are you + 国籍/职业?","explanation":"","original":{"en":"Are you Swedish?","zh":"你是瑞典人吗？"},"examples":[{"en":"Are you a tourist?","zh":"你是游客吗？"},{"en":"Are you Danish?","zh":"你是丹麦人吗？"}]},{"pattern":"Are they + 国籍 + too?","explanation":"","original":{"en":"Are your friends Danish too?","zh":"你的朋友们也是丹麦人吗？"},"examples":[{"en":"Are they Norwegian too?","zh":"他们也是挪威人吗？"},{"en":"Are your colleagues students too?","zh":"你的同事们也是学生吗？"}]},{"pattern":"Are these/those your + 名词?","explanation":"","original":{"en":"Are these your cases?","zh":"这些是你们的箱子吗？"},"examples":[{"en":"Are those your bags?","zh":"那些是你的包吗？"},{"en":"Are these your passports?","zh":"这些是你的护照吗？"}]},{"pattern":"Here + 代词 + are","explanation":"","original":{"en":"Here they are.","zh":"给你。/它们在这儿。"},"examples":[{"en":"Here it is.","zh":"给你。/它在这儿。"},{"en":"Here we are.","zh":"我们到了。/给你。"}]}]}
